ification. It looks at what points and badges get wrong and what lessons game design offers for non-game applications.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters recommend it as a thoughtful take on doing gamification and game design well.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"gamification\",\"categories\":[\"Game design\",\"UX & UI design\",\"Psychology & human behavior\"],\"tags\":[\"gamification\",\"game design\",\"motivation\",\"engagement\",\"ux\"],\"quote\":\"getting it right can make really powerful games\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"7ZVWIELHQQY\",\"title\":\"Craig Ferguson Speaks From The Heart\",\"channel\":\"Monke96ify\",\"summary\":\"A clip of Craig Ferguson's late-night monologue in which he talks about his past as an alcoholic. He explains why he will not mock Britney Spears over her breakdown.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN users share it in threads on drinking and addiction as an honest account of alcoholism and sobriety.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"alcoholism\",\"categories\":[\"Mental health & neurodiversity\",\"Stand-up & sketch comedy\"],\"tags\":[\"craig ferguson\",\"addiction\",\"sobriety\",\"late night\",\"mental health\"],\"quote\":\"Craig Ferguson's comments on alcoholism are worth listening to\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"7kVeCqQCxlk\",\"title\":\"CSS Grid Changes EVERYTHING - Amazing Presentation\",\"channel\":\"Coding Tech\",\"summary\":\"Morten Rand-Hendriksen's WordCamp Europe 2017 talk presents CSS Grid Layout as a native two-dimensional layout system that changes how web pages are structured, including responsive layouts independent of source order. It was given as browsers began shipping support.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters recommend it as an inspiring demonstration of how powerful CSS Grid is and how it repairs the relationship between HTML and CSS.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"css grid layout\",\"categories\":[\"Web development\"],\"tags\":[\"css grid\",\"responsive design\",\"web layout\",\"front-end\",\"wordcamp\"],\"quote\":\"The speaker is good but I think I like it just because it fixes the relationship between HTML and CSS.\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"7nJgHBbEgsE\",\"title\":\"Dr. Jason Fung: Fasting as a Therapeutic Option for Weight Loss\",\"channel\":\"CrossFit\",\"summary\":\"Dr. Jason Fung's talk at the 2018 CrossFit Health Conference on therapeutic fasting for weight loss. He explains why long-term weight loss is hard and tackles common myths.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN people point to Fung as the best resource for understanding fasting and weight loss.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"intermittent fasting\",\"categories\":[\"Nutrition & diet science\",\"Medicine & infectious disease\"],\"tags\":[\"jason fung\",\"weight loss\",\"type 2 diabetes\",\"fasting\",\"nutrition\"],\"quote\":\"The best resource for weight loss via fasting is Dr. Jason Fung\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"7pSqk-XV2QM\",\"title\":\"How Kodak Exposed Nuclear Testing\",\"channel\":\"Veritasium\",\"summary\":\"Veritasium tells how Kodak film was fogged by radioactive fallout from the first atomic tests, letting the company detect nuclear testing before anyone announced it. The video also covers the deal to keep it quiet and how fallout contaminated packaging.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters bring it up as a good related watch in any thread about fallout, nuclear tests or detecting hidden events through indirect evidence.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"nuclear testing history\",\"categories\":[\"Military history & warfare\",\"World history\",\"Scientific method & science communication\"],\"tags\":[\"kodak\",\"radioactive fallout\",\"atomic bomb\",\"film fogging\",\"cold war\"],\"quote\":\"Veritasium did an eye opening vid on how fallout blew across the country and was ruining K