It is posted on a channel that opposes climate consensus.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters point to it as a prominent physicist's skeptical counter-view, usually when someone asks for dissenting opinions.\",\"content_type\":\"interview\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"climate skepticism\",\"categories\":[\"Climate policy, solutions & debate\",\"Climate science & climate change\"],\"tags\":[\"freeman dyson\",\"global warming\",\"climate models\",\"co2\",\"skepticism\"],\"quote\":\"He explains his position quite coherently\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"BiqDZlAZygU\",\"title\":\"In full: Rowan Atkinson on free speech\",\"channel\":\"Defend Free Speech\",\"summary\":\"Rowan Atkinson's speech at the launch of the Reform Section 5 campaign in Parliament in 2012. He argues against criminalizing insulting words and for answering speech with more speech.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as an eloquent defense of free speech against laws on offensive or insulting speech.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"free speech\",\"categories\":[\"Free speech, censorship & civil liberties\",\"Law, policing & justice\"],\"tags\":[\"rowan atkinson\",\"free speech\",\"section 5\",\"censorship\",\"uk law\"],\"quote\":\"Rowan Atkinson made an excellent speech on the matter back then [2]\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"BwGsr3SzCZc\",\"title\":\"Black Hat USA 2013 - OPSEC failures of spies\",\"channel\":\"Black Hat\",\"summary\":\"Journalist Matthew Cole's Black Hat 2013 talk on the CIA's operational security failures in the 2003 Milan kidnapping. Phone and location metadata exposed the team and led to arrest warrants.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a non-technical, concrete case study of how metadata and phone records expose covert operations.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"opsec and metadata\",\"categories\":[\"Security & hacking\",\"Privacy, surveillance & cybercrime\",\"Geopolitics & f