e, including table faro shuffles. The routine builds in intensity and ends with a surprising finish.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN people share it as a classic example of sleight-of-hand mastery whose ending is mind-blowing.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"card magic\",\"categories\":[\"Magic, puzzles & curiosities\"],\"tags\":[\"ricky jay\",\"card manipulation\",\"sleight of hand\",\"faro shuffle\",\"magic\"],\"quote\":\"The manipulations are pretty amazing and then at the end it's mindblowing.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"U_X5uR7VC4M\",\"title\":\"You Suck at Photoshop - Distort, Warp, & Layer Effects\",\"channel\":\"My Damn Channel\",\"summary\":\"An episode of the comedic You Suck at Photoshop series in which Donnie Hoyle teaches distort, warp and layer effects while vandalizing a Vanagon in the image. It won Webby awards as a how-to and comedy series.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a classic, funny Photoshop tutorial series with a strong comedic personality.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"photoshop tutorials\",\"categories\":[\"Design & graphics (other)\",\"Satire & parody\"],\"tags\":[\"photoshop\",\"comedy\",\"image editing\",\"warp\",\"layer effects\"],\"quote\":\"Enjoy and you're welcome!\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"Ucp0TTmvqOE\",\"title\":\"Tesla Autonomy Day\",\"channel\":\"Tesla\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's roughly four-hour Autonomy Day investor event covers its in-house self-driving chip, vision-only approach, fleet data engine and robotaxi plans, with talks by Andrej Karpathy and others.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited both as a primary source on Tesla's technical autonomy approach and, later, for Musk's unmet robotaxi predictions.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"tesla self-driving\",\"categories\":[\"Self-driving & autonomous vehicles\",\"Machine learning & deep learning\",\"Tech company stories & documentaries\"],\"tags\":[