3.0},{\"vid\":\"sg2j7mZ9-2Y\",\"title\":\"w\",\"channel\":\"jan Misali\",\"summary\":\"jan Misali traces the history of the letter W, including why it is called double u. The video is part of a series of deep dives into individual letters.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended for readers who enjoy fascinating deep dives into the history of odd letters and the alphabet.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"history of the alphabet\",\"categories\":[\"Language & linguistics\",\"Graphic design & typography\"],\"tags\":[\"letter w\",\"alphabet history\",\"linguistics\",\"writing systems\",\"jan misali\"],\"quote\":\"If you're interested in fascinating deep dives into the history of a few odd letters\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"sycgL3Qg_Ak\",\"title\":\"How to Age Gracefully | CBC Radio\",\"channel\":\"CBC\",\"summary\":\"A five-minute CBC Radio WireTap farewell video in which people of all ages offer words of wisdom to younger people. The advice is short and funny, and keeps coming back to the point that nobody really knows what they are doing.\",\"why_hn\":\"Commenters bring it up in threads about life advice and aging as the best advice they have heard, namely to ignore advice and do your own thing.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"life advice\",\"categories\":[\"Productivity & self-improvement\",\"Arts & entertainment (other)\"],\"tags\":[\"aging\",\"advice\",\"wiretap\",\"cbc radio\",\"humor\"],\"quote\":\"Best advice on this topic: How to Age Gracefully | CBC Radio\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":3.0},{\"vid\":\"szIGZVrSAyc\",\"title\":\"Yanis Varoufakis with Professor Noam Chomsky at NYPL, April 16, 2016 | DiEM25\",\"channel\":\"DiEM25\",\"summary\":\"Yanis Varoufakis and Noam Chomsky talk on stage at the New York Public Library in 2016. They cover the Greek financial crisis, European politics, neoliberalism and America's economic future, drawing on Varoufakis's book.\",\"why_hn\":