ich even if you ignore the file size, is just a very cool use of fractals.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"13eiDhuvM6Y\",\"title\":\"Deception, Lies, and Valve\",\"channel\":\"Coffeezilla\",\"summary\":\"Coffeezilla investigates Counter-Strike skin gambling, the role of Valve and the legal and PR response, including effects on minors.\",\"why_hn\":\"Pointed to in threads on CS skin economy and Valve as an investigation arguing Valve is complicit in underage gambling.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"counter-strike skin gambling\",\"categories\":[\"Gaming culture & analysis\",\"Games (other)\",\"Law, policing & justice\"],\"tags\":[\"coffeezilla\",\"valve\",\"csgo\",\"gambling\",\"investigative\"],\"quote\":\"I highly recommend the videos.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"1PGm8LslEb4\",\"title\":\"Manipulating the YouTube Algorithm - (Part 1/3) Smarter Every Day 213\",\"channel\":\"SmarterEveryDay\",\"summary\":\"Part 1 of Smarter Every Day's three-part series on manipulating the YouTube algorithm. It features Renee DiResta and examples of how social media platforms can be manipulated.\",\"why_hn\":\"Referenced in threads on social media manipulation and junk content as an interesting miniseries, though one commenter criticized its ExpressVPN ad read.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"youtube algorithm manipulation\",\"categories\":[\"Media, journalism & propaganda\",\"AI & data (other)\",\"Internet culture & memes\"],\"tags\":[\"youtube\",\"recommendation algorithms\",\"misinformation\",\"social media\",\"bots\"],\"quote\":\"Destin Sandlin explores how YouTube, Twitter, and Facebook are being used as a sort of vanguard in a meta-game to undermine our trust\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5}",
    ",{\"vid\":\"1Y1kJpHBn50\",\"title\":\"How to Design Impenetrable Airport Security\",\"channel\":\"Wendover Productions\",\"summary\":\"A Wendover Productions explainer on how airport security is designed, covering screening layers, x-ray scanning, and the contrast with Israel's profiling-based approach. It walks through the logic behind why security works the way it does.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters point to it as a well-researched primer when airport security theatre and Israeli-style screening come up.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"airport security\",\"categories\":[\"Aviation & aerospace engineering\",\"Security & hacking\",\"Law, policing & justice\"],\"tags\":[\"airport security\",\"security theatre\",\"screening\",\"profiling\",\"aviation\"],\"quote\":\"If you actually want to be informed on the subject I highly recommend\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"1b-bijO3uEw\",\"title\":\"Deus Ex Morpheus Conversation [1080p Widescreen]\",\"channel\":\"Darkangel754\",\"summary\":\"A 1080p widescreen capture of the Deus Ex conversation between JC Denton and the AI Morpheus. It is a philosophical exchange that includes surveillance as a replacement for God.\",\"why_hn\":\"Commenters call it one of the game's best dialogues and bring it up in discussions of mass surveillance.\",\"content_type\":\"other\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"deus ex surveillance dialogue\",\"categories\":[\"Film & TV clips\",\"Privacy, surveillance & cybercrime\",\"Gaming culture & analysis\"],\"tags\":[\"deus ex\",\"morpheus\",\"surveillance\",\"game writing\",\"ai\"],\"quote\":\"My favorite conversation in the game is probably the one with the AI Morpheus\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"1f6YyH62jFE\",\"title\":\"37C3 -  Operation Triangulation: What You Get When Attack iPhones of Researchers\",\"channel\":\"media.ccc.de\",\"summary\":\"A 37C3 talk by Kaspersky researchers on Operation Triangulation, a zero-click iPhone attack that targeted their own colleagues. They describe capturing every stage of the chain, four zero-days and a previously unknown spyware active for years.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as a gripping look at what nation-state attackers can do, used as the primary source in threads about iPhone security and Kaspersky.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"advanced\",\"primary_topic\":\"ios zero-click exploits\",\"categories\":[\"Security & hacking\",\"Privacy, surveillance & cybercrime\"],\"tags\":[\"operation triangulation\",\"ios security\",\"zero-day\",\"spyware\",\"kaspersky\"],\"quote\":\"was a rollercoaster of a ride. If you have the time to watch it I highly recommend it!\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"1sd26pWhfmg\",\"title\":\"Nicholas Carlini - Black-hat LLMs | [un]prompted 2026\",\"channel\":\"unprompted\",\"summary\":\"Nicholas Carlini of Anthropic talks at [un]prompted 2026 about how adversaries could misuse current LLMs for attacks. He shows recent models finding zero-day vulnerabilities in heavily tested software, including a SQL injection in Ghost.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as a concrete demonstration that LLMs have suddenly become strong at finding and exploiting vulnerabilities.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"llm vulnerability research\",\"categories\":[\"Security & hacking\",\"LLMs & generative AI\"],\"tags\":[\"zero-day\",\"security\",\"llm\",\"fuzzing\",\"exploit development\",\"claude\"],\"quote\":\"This talk changed my view on where we're actually at\",\"recommenders\":9,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"29u_FejNuks\",\"title\":\"Making Mushroom Ketchup - 18th Century Cooking\",\"channel\":\"Townsends\",\"summary\":\"The Townsends channel shows how to make mushroom ketchup, a popular 18th-century sauce, in period style. It includes the history and a recipe and links to a blog post on whether George Washington used ketchup.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters who have cooked it 