ving\",\"categories\":[\"Philosophy & ethics\",\"University lectures & courses\"],\"tags\":[\"peter singer\",\"effective altruism\",\"moral philosophy\",\"famine affluence morality\",\"charity\"],\"quote\":\"I think the video is the best short exposition but you could try reading the paper the video is about\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"LKJBND_IRdI\",\"title\":\"The Uncanny Valley Is Wrong\",\"channel\":\"This Place\",\"summary\":\"This Place argues that the uncanny valley is a flawed concept, since 'human likeness' is too broad and the supporting evidence is cherry-picked. It proposes that the creepiness really comes from how animated characters and robots move.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a convincing counterargument to the widely repeated idea of the uncanny valley.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"uncanny valley\",\"categories\":[\"Robotics\",\"Animation & visual effects\",\"Psychology & human behavior\"],\"tags\":[\"uncanny valley\",\"robotics\",\"animation\",\"human likeness\",\"perception\"],\"quote\":\"here's an amazing video making a convincing argument that \\\"Uncanny Valley\\\" isn't a thing\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"LS3GQk9ETRU\",\"title\":\"Magnetohydrodynamics - Propelling Liquid Metal with Magnets!\",\"channel\":\"Tech Ingredients\",\"summary\":\"Tech Ingredients explains the principles of magnetohydrodynamics and builds several demonstrations, including propelling liquid metal and electrolytes with magnets and a railgun-style setup.\",\"why_hn\":\"It comes up as a great explainer on magnetohydrodynamic drives and pumps in threads about silent submarine propulsion.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"magnetohydrodynamics\",\"categories\":[\"Everyday physics & science demos\",\"Fundamental physics\",\"3D printing, CNC & maker projects\"],\"tags\":[\"mhd\",\"liquid metal\",\"magnets\",\"propulsion\",\"electrolytes\"],\"quote\":